From 3d6f52a82ba06b73504de8a821601abe305e7df5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:26:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] cecd: give a new box's OutBox index its empty header (Build
 130)

With the built-in StreetPass service (online LLE modules off), Nintendogs +
Cats registering StreetPass created its InBox and OutBox, then opened
OutBox__/OBIndex_____ to read it. This HLE opens every file with create,
so it made an empty file and answered size 0; the game then asked for the
index again (SetData option 0) about 600 times and crashed (undefined
instruction, stack overflow) before writing its MBoxInfo.

An OutBox index that is empty when opened now gets the 8-byte header the
real module writes: magic 'gg' (0x6767), 0 messages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
---
 BUILD-NUMBER                       |  2 +-
 src/core/hle/service/cecd/cecd.cpp | 10 ++++++++++
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/BUILD-NUMBER b/BUILD-NUMBER
index b0d7324..fd03ab2 100644
--- a/BUILD-NUMBER
+++ b/BUILD-NUMBER
@@ -1 +1 @@
-129
+130
diff --git a/src/core/hle/service/cecd/cecd.cpp b/src/core/hle/service/cecd/cecd.cpp
index b4d9189..8ae9e92 100644
--- a/src/core/hle/service/cecd/cecd.cpp
+++ b/src/core/hle/service/cecd/cecd.cpp
@@ -119,6 +119,16 @@ void Module::Interface::Open(Kernel::HLERequestContext& ctx) {
             rb.Push<u32>(0); // No file size
         } else {
             session_data->file = std::move(file_result).Unwrap();
+            if (path_type == CecDataPathType::OutboxIndex && session_data->file->GetSize() == 0) {
+                // A new box's OutBox index: the file was only just created (this HLE opens
+                // every file with create). Give it the empty index header the real module
+                // writes ('gg', 0 messages); a game that reads 0 bytes here (Nintendogs + Cats)
+                // keeps asking for the index until it crashes.
+                const std::array<u8, sizeof(CecOBIndexHeader)> empty_index{0x67, 0x67};
+                session_data->file->Write(0, empty_index.size(), true, false,
+                                          empty_index.data());
+                LOG_INFO(Service_CECD, "New OutBox index for box {:08x}", ncch_program_id);
+            }
             rb.Push(ResultSuccess);
             rb.Push<u32>(static_cast<u32>(session_data->file->GetSize())); // Return file size
         }
